  "description": "Fear comes home in this highly acclaimed survival horror experience which revitalised the Resident Evil series on its release with its  dramatic shift to a first-person viewpoint.\n\nProtagonist Ethan Winters is an ordinary man thrust into extraordinary circumstances as the search for his missing wife leads him to a seemingly abandoned Louisiana house. The horrors that await within its walls will shake you to your core... Powered by Capcom’s RE Engine, Resident Evil 7 delivers an unprecedented level of immersion that brings the thrilling horror up close and personal.\n \nThe Gold Edition includes:\n- Resident Evil 7 biohazard main game\n- Banned Footage Vol.1\n- Banned Footage Vol.2\n- Not a Hero\n- End of Zoe\n- Survival Pack DLC (Supply Boxes x 6, Coins x 5, Madhouse difficulty instant unlock)\n\nNote: The Madhouse difficulty level unlock included in the Survival Pack provides instant access to content which is otherwise unlockable by completing the game on any other difficulty level.",
